From e3fe2e579530712a4914ab8ae28ef6434e8a6b1f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sirius902 <10891979+Sirius902@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:47:49 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] Port the launcher, wizard and browser to Qt 6

Qt 5 is end of life. This follows OpenMW's port
(https://gitlab.com/OpenMW/openmw/-/merge_requests/2332), whose diffs don't
apply to 0.47, without Core5Compat: the wizard now converts Morrowind.ini's
code page with the engine's own encoder instead of QTextCodec.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
